+
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|Parameters                                                                    |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|Name              |Description                                                |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|uint32 hw_type    |Memory group identifier.                                   |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|uint32 mon_idx    |Monitor index within the group.                            |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
