+MEMLAT_MON_FREQ_MAP
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+param_id: 0x20 (32)
+command:  QCOM_SCMI_SET_PARAM
+
+Programs the cpufreq to memfreq voting table for a single monitor.
