+command:  QCOM_SCMI_GET_PARAM
+
+Reads the firmware timestamp (nanoseconds).
+
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|Return values                                                                 |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|int32 status      |SUCCESS.                                                   |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
+|uint64 tstamp     |Firmware timestamp in nanoseconds.                         |
++------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------+
